OL,3,GNEWSAParents patrol closed private
OL,4,Aschool after break-ins
OL,5,
OL,6,FParents of pupils at a private school
OL,7,Fthat closed suddenly have started
OL,8,Fpatrolling the grounds at night
OL,9,Ffollowing trespassing and an attempted
OL,10,Fbreak-in.
OL,12,FLeweston School, just outside
OL,13,FSherborne, shut on 27 October and
OL,14,Fnotified parents via email that it
OL,15,Fwould not reopen after the half term.
OL,17,FSince then, a group of mums and dads
OL,18,Fhave been taking it in turns to carry
OL,19,Fout security patrol shifts around the
OL,20,F46-acre site.
OL,23,APub: 08-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
